{"version":1,"key":"card:158","content":{"id":158,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Canvas 基本使用。准备一个画布"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<canvas id=\"canvas\"></canvas>","language":"html","uuid":"30e69db5-5062-41bc-a2bf-0853a82f70b1","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"画布的大小可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"width","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"height","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 属性规定，默认为 "},{"type":"inline-math","tex":"300 \\times 150","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"300 \\times 150"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，当浏览器不支持 canvas 时，我们可以在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"<canvas></canvas>","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中放置后备内容，这样当浏览器不支持时就会显示后备内容。"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"<canvas>\n\t您的浏览器不支持canvas，请升级到最新版本！\n</canvas>","language":"html","uuid":"8ebdd41a-220e-4e5a-a811-1bdde6c9bbb0","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"准备好画布以后，我们可以通过画布的绘制上下文(context)在画布中绘制内容，我们通过 getContext() 方法来获得绘制上下文，该方法接受一个参数，取值如下"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"2d"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"webgl"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"分别表示获得 2D 上下文和 WebGL(用来绘制3D图案) 上下文，这里我们主要介绍使用 2D 上下文来进行绘制"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 获得 DOM 元素\nconst canvas = document.getElementById('canvas')\n// 获得 2d 绘制上下文\nconst ctx = canvas.getContext('2d')","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6873d1ec-28fd-4630-ab79-4e6fdc701556","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"绘制上下文为我们提供了很多的 API 让我们能够绘制形状，文字，图片等等，以及能够设定颜色，字体等等功能"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"// 设置填充颜色\nctx.fillStyle = 'rgb(207, 85, 119)'\n// 绘制一个左上角在 (0, 0)，长宽为 150 * 100 的矩形\nctx.fillRect(0, 0, 150, 100)","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e4779103-9ab3-494a-89d4-25285a175a05","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["Canvas"],"createTime":1690247286125,"updateTime":1743303640406,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640406}}